    "body": "## Added\r\n\r\n- **CNB update channel** — Add CNB as a new self-update channel (self_update_channel=2) with CI mirror push to [cnb.cool](https://cnb.cool/libs_repo/chrome_green_release).\r\n- **Settings layout rework** — Proxy is now rarely needed, so its config moved into Advanced settings; the hotkey mappings were promoted to a top-level tab on the main config page."
