    "body": "> [!NOTE]\r\n> Since 2.0.9, users in mainland China can update ChromeGreen via the [Gitee channel](https://gitee.com/iicm/chrome_green_release)( (built and distributed by GitHub)  — no update proxy needed.\r\n\r\n## Added\r\n\r\n- **Gitee update channel** — the settings page gains a *ChromeGreen Update Channel* selector (GitHub / Gitee, Gitee by default) for `version.dll` updates.\r\n- **Open clipboard via hotkey** — a new `open_clipboard` action reads clipboard text and opens it as tabs. (#3)\r\n\r\n## Fixed\r\n\r\n- Close-on-last-tab for mode `2` now works in **vertical tabs** and in **incognito**. (#3)\r\n- gracefully close Chrome on update and restore session. (#5)"
  },
