    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/libsgh/chrome_green/zipball/2.0.6",
    "body": "## Features\r\n\r\n- **Tabs:**&#8203; auto-hide the bookmark bar — show it only while the mouse is over the omnibox row or the bar itself, with a configurable hide delay. Turning the feature off restores the bar.\r\n- **Tabs:**&#8203; open dropped links in a background tab — dropping a link on the page content opens it next to the current tab and leaves the current page focused, instead of navigating in place.\r\n- **Web:**&#8203; confirm settings saves with a toast — every toggle, input and dropdown now reports success or failure. Also fixes `@blur`/`@change` handlers passing the DOM event as `forceRecheck`, which silently reset the update state and re-checked on every blur.\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- keep the config page tab bar pinned while the page scrolls, so the active section stays reachable.\r\n- hide the \"excluded tab names\" and delay inputs unless their owning switch is on.\r\n"
  },
