    "body": "### Features\r\n\r\n- **Config**: add cache directory config and consolidate ChromeGreen data files #1\r\nSupport cg_data_dir custom data directory (defaults to cache dir, supports relative/absolute paths),\r\nmoving `favicons`, update state (`chrome_green_update.json`) and boss-key mute flag into the\r\nChromeGreenData subfolder.\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n- clear desktop shortcut tooltip description."
