    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/libsgh/chrome_green/zipball/2.0.4",
    "body": "### Features\r\n\r\n- **Taskbar**: add experimental \"fix taskbar context menu\" toggle (on by default, in Other settings) — registers localized jump-list tasks (New window / Incognito / Recently opened tabs); when off, a portable Chrome pinned by any method shows only \"Unpin\"\r\n- **Updater**: install a local Omaha update package placed in `updates/` from the config page; complete a pending file swap on restart when chrome.exe is in use\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- **Hotkey**: heal the stale per-app mute left behind when Chrome exits while hidden via the boss key — match processes by full image path, walk all render endpoints, and add a mute flag file with startup self-heal\r\n- **Updater**: allow downgrade when switching release channels\r\n- **Config page**: send `Cache-Control: no-cache` so the page always reflects the latest DLL — no more Ctrl+F5 after updating"
  },
